## Enhanced carbon capture with motif-rich amino acid loaded defective robust metal-organic frameworks
Qi-Ye Ju\(^{1,3,4}\), Jia-Jia Zheng\(^{2}\), Li Xu\(^{1,3,4}\), Hai-Yan Jiang\(^{1,5}\), Zi-Qian Xue\(^{6}\), Lu Bai\(^{1,5}\), Yang-Yang Guo\(^{1,2}\), (✉), Ming-Shui Yao\(^{1,5}\) (✉), and Ting-Yu Zhu\(^{1,5}\) (✉)
